      "@en": "It presents it as an absolute certainty."
     },
     "explicacion": {
      "@es": "No añade ese matiz.",
      "@en": "It doesn't add that nuance."
     }
    },
    {
     "texto": {
      "@es": "La convierte en una pregunta.",
      "@en": "It makes it a question."
     },
     "explicacion": {
